This repository is a MODIFIED VERSION of Mirage Cloud Panel
(https://github.com/victorglazunoff/mirage-cloud-panel), which is itself a
modified version of CloudCLI UI (see above). Modified in November 2026,
distributed under the same AGPL-3.0-or-later with the same additional terms.
The modifications include, among others:

  - security fixes from an independent review: file access confined to the
    project through symlinks, private files (keys, credentials, the panel
    database) never served, sign-ins without a session id refused, the
    in-panel "update" button off by default, sanitized SVG previews,
    security headers, IPv6 throttling, calendar text marked as data;
  - a home «Сервер» widget, the 5-hour session limit, per-model weekly limits;
  - a panel time zone setting, Telegram approvals that actually arrive,
    masked secrets in Telegram messages, local fonts;
  - files: right-click menu, new file, copy/move between projects,
    multi-select, zip download; «Классика» link to the authors' interface;
  - chat: the model shown on every reply, Claude's thoughts as folded lines;
  - server install, HTTPS and update scripts (scripts/server/).
